WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.930
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:08.200 --> 00:09.360
Do you like Yok?

3
00:12.480 --> 00:14.640
That face of yours doesn't just belong to you.

4
00:14.760 --> 00:16.680
It carries the name of the Sukonsiri family.

5
00:16.960 --> 00:19.000
Isn't he supposed to be handling this project?

6
00:19.760 --> 00:22.480
Yes, but he's currently on leave.

7
00:23.160 --> 00:24.160
Let go of me.

8
00:25.560 --> 00:26.360
Why?

9
00:26.400 --> 00:28.520
You have no right to touch her shares.

10
00:31.640 --> 00:34.680
Why won't you just give up on this already?

11
00:43.640 --> 00:44.840
What on earth am I wearing?

12
00:45.080 --> 00:46.760
Is this the best shirt you could find?

13
00:47.400 --> 00:48.440
Just wear it.

14
00:50.480 --> 00:51.080
No way.

15
00:51.640 --> 00:54.520
I'm going to give you a fashion lesson sometime, okay?

16
00:59.440 --> 01:00.600
I'm leaving.

17
01:01.800 --> 01:02.600
Where are you going?

18
01:03.280 --> 01:04.319
Who said you could leave?

19
01:05.480 --> 01:07.240
Now, get in the car.

20
01:08.000 --> 01:09.480
Tomorrow's a day off.

21
01:09.600 --> 01:11.160
You have to keep me company.

22
01:12.200 --> 01:12.960
Will you?

23
01:13.680 --> 01:14.640
Come on, get in.

24
01:16.240 --> 01:17.200
Get in the car.

25
01:18.520 --> 01:19.360
Fine.

26
01:21.360 --> 01:22.280
P'Ing...

27
01:27.600 --> 01:28.800
Make me something to eat, too.

28
03:53.120 --> 03:54.600
I'm hungry.

29
03:54.680 --> 03:57.720
I'm so hungry and exhausted.

30
03:58.800 --> 04:00.240
Want me to whip something up for you?

31
04:00.280 --> 04:00.960
Yes.

32
04:03.560 --> 04:05.400
What are you going to make?

33
04:05.440 --> 04:06.360
Give me a second.

34
04:06.400 --> 04:08.040
What are you making?

35
04:12.000 --> 04:13.000
What do you want to eat?

36
04:17.600 --> 04:18.959
Let's check the fridge.

37
04:25.120 --> 04:26.120
There's nothing in here.

38
04:28.400 --> 04:29.640
Just go get some rest.

39
04:29.640 --> 04:30.720
I'll handle it.

40
04:32.760 --> 04:33.960
You're so sweet.

41
04:34.600 --> 04:35.800
I'll be waiting for it.

42
05:34.920 --> 05:35.720
P'Ing.

43
05:37.159 --> 05:39.240
P'Ing, wake up and eat.

44
05:39.880 --> 05:41.280
No, I'm sleepy.

45
05:45.320 --> 05:46.960
Get up right now.

46
05:51.640 --> 05:53.040
Eat your food.

47
05:53.400 --> 05:54.560
Fine.

48
05:54.600 --> 05:55.840
Sit up, come on.

49
05:55.920 --> 05:56.560
I'll eat.

50
05:57.400 --> 05:58.159
I'll eat...

51
06:00.680 --> 06:01.720
I'll eat my food.

52
06:07.240 --> 06:07.960
Where is it?

53
06:09.600 --> 06:10.640
Feed me first.

54
06:21.800 --> 06:23.720
You're so sweet. Even blew on it for me?

55
06:37.280 --> 06:38.280
This is actually good.

56
06:39.960 --> 06:40.800
You're good at pampering me,

57
06:40.800 --> 06:41.960
and you're a great cook.

58
06:42.400 --> 06:43.960
Now you're finally acting like a bottom.

59
06:45.520 --> 06:46.560
Who's your bottom?

60
06:47.920 --> 06:48.720
I'm your top.

61
07:14.880 --> 07:16.560
Your cooking is really something.

62
07:18.000 --> 07:18.720
It's nothing special.

63
07:18.760 --> 07:21.280
Tell me. Who else have you cooked for?

64
07:21.560 --> 07:23.840
I just cook for myself at the dorm.

65
07:27.400 --> 07:28.840
Now that's a great answer.

66
07:28.840 --> 07:29.640
Alright.

67
07:32.640 --> 07:33.760
I'll give you a little reward.

68
07:40.600 --> 07:41.560
Your mom?

69
07:45.240 --> 07:46.240
Hello, Mom.

70
07:47.680 --> 07:49.600
Yok, it's already 9:30.

71
07:49.640 --> 07:50.920
Are you coming home soon?

72
07:51.640 --> 07:53.320
I made some chicken soup.

73
07:53.360 --> 07:54.560
It's still nice and warm.

74
07:54.560 --> 07:57.000
I have something to take care of at the college.

75
07:57.560 --> 07:59.440
I won't be able to come home for a few days.

76
08:03.520 --> 08:05.720
Hello, ma'am. It's me.

77
08:06.440 --> 08:07.080
Yes.

78
08:07.560 --> 08:09.520
I'm the one Yok is interning with.

79
08:10.760 --> 08:12.080
The thing is...

80
08:12.600 --> 08:14.880
something came up at my company,

81
08:14.960 --> 08:16.880
so I really need Yok's help.

82
08:16.920 --> 08:17.920
I'm very sorry, ma'am,

83
08:17.960 --> 08:20.560
but I'll need to borrow Yok for a couple of days.

84
08:21.320 --> 08:23.160
I'll take excellent care of him.

85
08:23.200 --> 08:25.080
I won't let a single ant anywhere near him.

86
08:25.800 --> 08:27.000
Oh...

87
08:27.720 --> 08:30.720
Ma'am, please talk to Yok again.

88
08:33.320 --> 08:34.280
Hello, Mom?

89
08:34.280 --> 08:35.440
Go ahead and focus on work.

90
08:35.480 --> 08:38.080
If you need anything, just call me anytime.

91
08:38.120 --> 08:40.039
Get some sleep, Mom. Good night.

92
08:43.039 --> 08:44.440
Are you out of your mind, P'Ing?

93
08:44.840 --> 08:45.840
I'm not.

94
08:45.880 --> 08:47.200
What's wrong with you?

95
08:47.240 --> 08:48.800
You can't even pick out your own shirt.

96
08:48.800 --> 08:50.440
Not everyone can be such a pro like you.

97
08:50.960 --> 08:52.120
But at least...

98
08:54.000 --> 08:55.280
I don't lie to you.

99
08:56.360 --> 08:58.080
You're all talk, P'Ing.

100
08:58.520 --> 09:00.280
I'm not all talk. My mouth has other skills, too.

101
09:01.120 --> 09:02.200
Can you handle this?

102
09:07.480 --> 09:08.480
Can you take it?

103
09:11.080 --> 09:12.200
Should we go to the sink?

104
09:12.800 --> 09:13.520
I'd prefer the couch.

105
09:42.520 --> 09:44.120
It has been nearly a month

106
09:44.160 --> 09:45.720
since Thailand entered the rainy season.

107
09:45.760 --> 09:46.200
Bangkok,

108
09:46.240 --> 09:46.840
the metropolitan areas,

109
09:46.840 --> 09:48.720
and most parts of Central Thailand

110
09:48.840 --> 09:50.160
remain under the influence

111
09:50.160 --> 09:52.360
of the southwest monsoon,

112
09:52.400 --> 09:54.280
causing humidity levels

113
09:54.280 --> 09:56.120
to remain consistently high.

114
09:56.160 --> 09:57.640
The public is advised

115
09:57.680 --> 09:59.600
to closely monitor weather forecasts

116
09:59.640 --> 10:00.680
and take precautions

117
10:00.720 --> 10:02.400
against changing weather.

118
10:10.920 --> 10:12.320
Happy Birthday.

119
10:12.320 --> 10:13.720
Make a wish before you blow out the candles.

120
10:32.800 --> 10:36.160
After months of rain, the rainy season has finally ended.

121
10:36.200 --> 10:37.400
Cold winds from the north

122
10:37.400 --> 10:38.840
are reaching Bangkok,

123
10:38.880 --> 10:39.680
the metropolitan areas,

124
10:39.720 --> 10:40.960
and Central Thailand.

125
10:40.960 --> 10:42.480
Where did you get all this energy?

126
10:42.520 --> 10:44.800
The skies are beginning to clear

127
10:44.840 --> 10:46.520
as the gentle morning sunshine

128
10:46.560 --> 10:49.240
and cool winds offer a break

129
10:49.280 --> 10:51.520
from the heat of the rainy season.

130
10:51.560 --> 10:53.960
The most pleasant time of the year

131
10:53.960 --> 10:55.440
has begun once again.

132
10:56.000 --> 10:56.960
Here, have some more.

133
10:57.000 --> 10:59.240
Alright, come on.

134
10:59.280 --> 11:01.000
-That's enough. -Keep it coming.

135
11:01.840 --> 11:03.040
-Cheers? -He's here.

136
11:03.920 --> 11:05.080
Hey, Ing.

137
11:05.840 --> 11:06.920
Over here.

138
11:07.640 --> 11:08.320
What's up?

139
11:08.720 --> 11:10.680
Look who finally showed up.

140
11:14.000 --> 11:15.000
Have you guys been here long?

141
11:15.160 --> 11:16.400
For a while now.

142
11:16.520 --> 11:18.560
Man, took you long enough to get here.

143
11:20.320 --> 11:21.320
And who's this?

144
11:22.960 --> 11:24.480
This is Yok, Phet's younger brother.

145
11:24.840 --> 11:27.600
I see.

146
11:28.520 --> 11:29.840
The one you're always talking about?

147
11:29.840 --> 11:30.560
Yeah.

148
11:31.040 --> 11:32.520
Finally getting to meet him in person.

149
11:32.560 --> 11:35.200
Wow, he's way more handsome than you made him out to be.

150
11:35.240 --> 11:36.800
He's interning with me right now.

151
11:39.520 --> 11:41.080
Feel free to give him some pointers.

152
11:45.200 --> 11:47.080
Make sure they're the good kind of pointers, though.

153
11:47.520 --> 11:48.360
With you mentoring him,

154
11:48.400 --> 11:49.800
does he even need us?

155
11:50.080 --> 11:50.800
Right?

156
11:51.000 --> 11:52.400
There's nothing left for us to teach him.

157
11:52.400 --> 11:53.120
Yeah.

158
11:53.160 --> 11:55.040
Especially if it's advice from you.

159
11:55.080 --> 11:56.640
Let's introduce ourselves.

160
11:56.680 --> 11:58.080
Pleased to meet you.

161
11:58.440 --> 11:59.480
My name is Leo.

162
12:00.800 --> 12:02.200
Hello, P'Leo.

163
12:04.960 --> 12:06.560
I'm in business, too,

164
12:06.920 --> 12:09.120
and I'm opening a new restaurant.

165
12:09.640 --> 12:12.280
Usually, Ing doesn't take anyone under his wing.

166
12:12.560 --> 12:14.520
That means you must be pretty special.

167
12:16.800 --> 12:18.400
He's definitely something else.

168
12:18.880 --> 12:20.600
He is special. Don't you agree?

169
12:23.960 --> 12:25.360
I'm going to the bathroom.

170
12:31.200 --> 12:32.240
It's nothing.

171
12:33.080 --> 12:34.360
He's just nervous.

172
12:34.360 --> 12:35.360
Give him some time.

173
12:54.120 --> 12:55.600
Why do you look so upset with me tonight?

174
12:57.320 --> 12:58.000
P'Ing,

175
12:58.360 --> 12:59.800
don't tell your friends about us again.

176
12:59.800 --> 13:00.560
What are you talking about?

177
13:01.960 --> 13:02.760
Oh...

178
13:03.320 --> 13:04.120
Why?

179
13:04.600 --> 13:06.520
I just wanted you to know my friends.

180
13:07.280 --> 13:08.280
I didn't mean anything by it.

181
13:08.800 --> 13:10.360
Can you stop overthinking things?

182
13:12.320 --> 13:13.040
Yok,

183
13:13.280 --> 13:15.200
I'm a straightforward guy.

184
13:15.880 --> 13:17.160
If you don't believe me, fine.

185
13:22.200 --> 13:23.160
It's getting late.

186
13:24.240 --> 13:25.320
I'll drive you home.

187
13:25.600 --> 13:26.840
I don't have any other plans.

188
13:27.360 --> 13:28.400
I'll keep you company.

189
13:36.840 --> 13:37.960
Listen carefully.

190
13:38.320 --> 13:39.560
I don't need anyone

191
13:39.600 --> 13:41.360
to pity me.

192
13:41.960 --> 13:42.920
And let me tell you this,

193
13:42.960 --> 13:44.200
it won't be long before I make you

194
13:44.240 --> 13:45.520
want to be mine.

195
13:48.880 --> 13:50.040
You don't need to give me a ride.

196
13:51.720 --> 13:52.680
I can go home by myself.

197
14:27.520 --> 14:28.720
Hey, not bad.

198
14:29.040 --> 14:30.760
Go on, get some water.

199
14:39.320 --> 14:39.800
[P'Ing,]

200
14:39.840 --> 14:41.240
[didn't you want me to teach you how to box?]

201
14:41.240 --> 14:42.600
[I'll be at the boxing gym all day tomorrow.]

202
14:42.600 --> 14:43.600
[Are you coming?]

203
14:43.600 --> 14:45.280
Hey, look at our future champ.

204
14:45.280 --> 14:46.920
What's so interesting on that phone?

205
14:50.640 --> 14:53.200
The results for the tryout round are coming out soon.

206
14:53.600 --> 14:54.720
Don't let me down.

207
14:56.040 --> 14:56.720
I won't.

208
15:09.240 --> 15:09.840
Good.

209
15:12.240 --> 15:13.040
Great.

210
15:18.280 --> 15:18.960
Yok...

211
15:20.600 --> 15:21.800
Your mind is wandering.

212
15:22.520 --> 15:23.600
You're losing focus.

213
15:24.080 --> 15:25.360
This isn't the first time.

214
15:25.840 --> 15:27.720
You know what the worst reason

215
15:27.760 --> 15:28.960
for a boxer to lose is?

216
15:29.920 --> 15:31.880
Because their mind is distracted.

217
15:36.800 --> 15:37.880
I'm sorry, P'Khun.

218
15:52.480 --> 15:54.480
Hello.

219
15:59.720 --> 16:00.480
Do I look good?

220
16:05.160 --> 16:06.320
It suits you well.

221
16:07.480 --> 16:09.200
Since I've come all this way,

222
16:09.200 --> 16:10.920
please take good care of me.

223
16:13.040 --> 16:15.720
Then let's start by warming up.

224
16:17.880 --> 16:19.640
Why so cold?

225
16:19.800 --> 16:21.880
You can't become good at boxing overnight.

226
16:22.280 --> 16:23.680
Since you said you wanted to learn,

227
16:24.160 --> 16:25.520
I have to take the training seriously.

228
16:26.880 --> 16:28.040
Keeping it cool, huh?

229
16:28.640 --> 16:29.840
I'll wait and see

230
16:29.880 --> 16:31.040
how good you really are.

231
16:38.400 --> 16:40.080
Drive the power from your hips.

232
16:40.120 --> 16:40.600
Like this?

233
16:40.640 --> 16:41.760
No, twist.

234
16:42.080 --> 16:43.160
-Twist upward. -Like this?

235
16:43.200 --> 16:44.160
-Twist. -Twist upward?

236
16:44.680 --> 16:45.360
Like this?

237
16:46.880 --> 16:47.480
P'Ing.

238
16:48.920 --> 16:49.960
Do you actually want to learn?

239
16:51.600 --> 16:52.200
I do.

240
16:53.560 --> 16:54.960
I'm being serious here.

241
16:57.600 --> 16:58.280
Is this alright?

242
17:00.200 --> 17:00.800
Do you want to learn?

243
17:00.800 --> 17:01.720
Yes, I am learning here.

244
17:04.760 --> 17:05.800
Now, twist your hips.

245
17:07.040 --> 17:07.599
That's it.

246
17:10.280 --> 17:11.160
That's correct.

247
17:11.200 --> 17:12.079
Is it too tight?

248
17:12.119 --> 17:12.920
It's just right.

249
17:13.680 --> 17:14.480
Okay.

250
17:15.400 --> 17:16.440
Stay still.

251
17:20.119 --> 17:21.800
Once you're finished, wrap it around the wrist.

252
17:23.440 --> 17:24.480
Do you remember any of this?

253
17:25.160 --> 17:26.440
No, it happened too fast.

254
17:27.520 --> 17:29.720
P'Ing, you have to do it properly.

255
17:30.000 --> 17:31.160
Otherwise, you might get hurt.

256
17:31.760 --> 17:32.680
Are you worried about me?

257
17:34.600 --> 17:35.720
There's no need for me to remember.

258
17:36.080 --> 17:37.320
Whenever I want to box,

259
17:37.360 --> 17:39.040
I'll just have you wrap them for me.

260
17:40.360 --> 17:41.960
Will I be with you all the time?

261
17:41.960 --> 17:42.480
Yes.

262
17:42.840 --> 17:43.640
Can't you?

263
17:47.080 --> 17:47.880
Stop smiling.

264
17:48.520 --> 17:49.720
Just admit it if you want to be with me.

265
17:50.240 --> 17:51.400
Here, the other hand.

266
17:54.360 --> 17:55.160
P'Ing.

267
17:55.640 --> 17:56.280
Do it right.

268
17:56.280 --> 17:57.240
Use your shoulders

269
17:57.280 --> 17:58.120
and twist your waist.

270
18:00.720 --> 18:02.360
Have you ever boxed before?

271
18:02.400 --> 18:03.360
I'm just a natural.

272
18:03.400 --> 18:05.280
Then let's go for another hundred punches.

273
18:05.840 --> 18:06.880
My punches are powerful, though.

274
18:11.040 --> 18:12.240
Hey, Yok.

275
18:13.080 --> 18:14.400
-Does it hurt a lot? -Ouch.

276
18:17.160 --> 18:18.320
-Just kidding. -I... Hey.

277
18:22.120 --> 18:23.440
Stop it. That tickles.

278
18:23.480 --> 18:24.720
Once I get up...

279
18:24.920 --> 18:25.560
Yok.

280
18:28.400 --> 18:29.320
Right here?

281
18:30.960 --> 18:31.960
Teach me now.

282
18:32.000 --> 18:32.680
P'Ing.

283
18:32.680 --> 18:33.840
Come on, teach me.

284
18:34.120 --> 18:34.920
Stop.

285
18:35.240 --> 18:36.040
Stop it.

286
18:36.560 --> 18:37.320
Teasing me, huh?

287
18:37.520 --> 18:38.280
Stop.

288
18:50.480 --> 18:51.240
Yok.

289
18:53.080 --> 18:53.920
Come sit over here.

290
18:54.360 --> 18:54.960
Okay.

291
19:02.440 --> 19:03.720
Why do you like boxing so much?

292
19:06.640 --> 19:07.920
Whenever I'm boxing,

293
19:10.280 --> 19:12.080
all my problems just seem to vanish.

294
19:13.720 --> 19:15.120
Everything becomes so simple.

295
19:16.440 --> 19:17.320
There's only punching,

296
19:18.560 --> 19:19.360
losing,

297
19:19.960 --> 19:20.880
or winning.

298
19:24.840 --> 19:25.640
Hold on,

299
19:27.040 --> 19:28.160
how is that even simple?

300
19:29.920 --> 19:31.320
You wouldn't understand.

301
19:35.760 --> 19:36.360
Look.

302
19:38.960 --> 19:39.920
Maybe sometimes,

303
19:40.920 --> 19:42.040
you're just making things

304
19:42.080 --> 19:43.320
more complicated than they need to be.

305
19:52.480 --> 19:54.280
Not everyone's like you,

306
19:55.880 --> 19:57.880
just acting on whatever they're thinking.

307
20:00.200 --> 20:02.240
Thinking things through is all well and good,

308
20:03.560 --> 20:05.280
but keeping it all bottled up isn't healthy.

309
20:07.000 --> 20:09.080
If you ever need to let it all out,

310
20:10.920 --> 20:12.040
I'm right here for you.

311
20:28.200 --> 20:29.760
This place is actually pretty chill,

312
20:29.760 --> 20:30.440
isn't it?

313
20:34.240 --> 20:35.080
Hey,

314
20:38.280 --> 20:39.680
aren't you crossing the line?

315
20:40.600 --> 20:41.520
Give me that cigarette.

316
20:42.280 --> 20:43.520
One, two, three.

317
20:43.560 --> 20:45.000
Smoking is bad for you.

318
20:47.920 --> 20:49.080
Caught me off guard, huh?

319
20:49.960 --> 20:51.080
If you're really that good,

320
20:52.680 --> 20:54.320
try to take this lighter from me.

321
21:05.640 --> 21:06.320
Whoa.

322
21:07.200 --> 21:08.080
How did you do that?

323
21:09.160 --> 21:09.920
Teach me.

324
21:10.400 --> 21:11.080
That was cool.

325
21:11.360 --> 21:12.480
Show me how to do it.

326
21:12.560 --> 21:13.400
How do I do that?

327
21:13.440 --> 21:14.240
How?

328
21:14.920 --> 21:15.680
How do I do it?

329
21:16.120 --> 21:16.880
Like this?

330
21:17.800 --> 21:18.920
Teach me.

331
21:18.960 --> 21:19.960
Hold my wrist.

332
21:20.000 --> 21:21.720
Hold it like this?

333
21:21.720 --> 21:22.840
Oh, like this?

334
21:22.880 --> 21:23.880
No, use the other hand.

335
21:23.920 --> 21:24.680
This hand...

336
21:27.120 --> 21:27.720
Ow...

337
21:30.840 --> 21:31.400
P'Ing.

338
21:31.440 --> 21:32.400
Are you alright?

339
21:32.440 --> 21:33.480
Did you do that on purpose?

340
21:33.520 --> 21:35.560
No, it just happened.

341
21:35.560 --> 21:36.560
My bad.

342
21:37.560 --> 21:38.920
Aw...

343
21:39.360 --> 21:40.480
How about this?

344
21:41.280 --> 21:42.960
If you can last a day without smoking,

345
21:43.400 --> 21:44.880
I'll keep you company tomorrow.

346
22:03.600 --> 22:04.520
Hello, Auntie.

347
22:04.720 --> 22:07.040
Hi, Ing. It's me.

348
22:07.120 --> 22:08.760
I'm calling to congratulate you, Ing.

349
22:09.160 --> 22:10.640
I heard the new condo

350
22:10.640 --> 22:12.760
is selling like hotcakes, right?

351
22:12.800 --> 22:14.000
Thank you.

352
22:14.280 --> 22:16.720
Actually, I wanted to ask you about something.

353
22:17.120 --> 22:19.080
I heard you're planning to set aside

354
22:19.080 --> 22:21.040
a few units for Director Pha-nu.

355
22:21.480 --> 22:25.360
Could you have Pite handle this instead?

356
22:30.040 --> 22:31.600
I'll have to see what everyone says

357
22:31.640 --> 22:33.120
in the meeting first.

358
22:33.960 --> 22:35.720
Alright. Goodbye.

359
22:41.200 --> 22:42.400
Dammit.

360
22:42.960 --> 22:44.600
How did Pite even know about this?

361
22:46.080 --> 22:46.920
Come in.

362
22:47.840 --> 22:48.800
How did Pite know

363
22:48.840 --> 22:50.560
we were securing units for Director Pha-nu?

364
22:50.600 --> 22:51.920
His mom just called me,

365
22:52.160 --> 22:54.080
begging me to let him in on the deal.

366
22:54.200 --> 22:55.200
I already told you

367
22:55.200 --> 22:56.240
to keep this under wraps.

368
22:56.240 --> 22:57.520
More people knowing means more risk.

369
22:57.800 --> 22:59.480
P'Ing, that day,

370
22:59.480 --> 23:01.720
he insisted on taking me out to eat,

371
23:01.760 --> 23:03.280
and when I went to the bathroom,

372
23:03.320 --> 23:04.480
he snooped through my documents.

373
23:04.520 --> 23:05.480
Then why did you leave

374
23:05.520 --> 23:06.600
sensitive documents lying around?

375
23:06.920 --> 23:08.680
I didn't think he'd snoop through them.

376
23:08.720 --> 23:09.480
When I got back,

377
23:09.480 --> 23:10.520
he asked me if the documents

378
23:10.560 --> 23:12.320
were meant for Director Pha-nu.

379
23:12.360 --> 23:13.680
I didn't give him an answer,

380
23:13.680 --> 23:14.840
but he assumed I was confirming it.

381
23:14.840 --> 23:16.160
Then he added that...

382
23:16.360 --> 23:18.240
the land for the hotel his mom is working on

383
23:18.280 --> 23:20.280
needs Director Pha-nu's approval as well.

384
23:20.760 --> 23:23.080
I think he's trying to use this opportunity

385
23:23.120 --> 23:24.760
to expand his connections.

386
23:24.920 --> 23:25.960
That jerk...

387
23:26.640 --> 23:28.000
I have to hand it to him.

388
23:28.040 --> 23:30.280
At least he's getting smarter.

389
23:30.800 --> 23:32.360
Instead of looking for business outside,

390
23:32.720 --> 23:34.000
he's decided to prey on his own family.

391
23:34.040 --> 23:34.840
How did he come up with that?

392
23:35.160 --> 23:37.840
P'Ing, what should I do?

393
23:38.200 --> 23:39.520
Tell me what you want me to do.

394
23:39.560 --> 23:40.720
I caused this mess,

395
23:40.760 --> 23:41.920
so I'll make it right.

396
23:43.120 --> 23:45.160
At least you're owning up to it.

397
23:45.160 --> 23:47.080
From now on, have Pite join the project.

398
23:47.080 --> 23:48.160
But if he screws anything up,

399
23:48.200 --> 23:49.160
it's on you.

400
23:49.520 --> 23:50.320
Understood.

401
23:53.000 --> 23:55.400
Keep sensitive documents more secure next time.

402
23:56.000 --> 23:57.080
If this happens again,

403
23:57.880 --> 23:59.200
don't bother coming back here.

404
24:00.480 --> 24:02.080
Understood. I'm sorry.

405
24:02.120 --> 24:02.960
You can go now.

406
24:05.000 --> 24:05.760
Okay.

407
24:20.920 --> 24:22.880
Dammit, I can't even have a smoke.

408
24:23.960 --> 24:24.920
Jeez.

409
24:29.280 --> 24:30.160
Hey.

410
24:30.200 --> 24:31.720
-P'Ing, hold on. -Hey.

411
24:33.240 --> 24:33.880
Hey.

412
24:36.920 --> 24:38.000
P'Ing, come on.

413
24:40.120 --> 24:40.880
You're dead.

414
24:42.120 --> 24:43.040
That's better.

415
24:43.080 --> 24:44.320
I went all day without smoking for you,

416
24:44.320 --> 24:46.200
and you're paying more attention to your game?

417
24:47.480 --> 24:49.400
Are you seriously jealous of a game?

418
24:52.880 --> 24:53.840
What game are you playing?

419
24:54.640 --> 24:56.280
Oh, this one?

420
24:56.600 --> 24:58.000
I've seen it on my feed.

421
24:58.800 --> 24:59.960
Shouldn't be that hard.

422
25:01.720 --> 25:02.680
Do you even know how to play?

423
25:03.320 --> 25:05.280
I can figure it out in one go.

424
25:05.480 --> 25:06.880
Want to bet I'll win?

425
25:07.960 --> 25:08.960
You're on.

426
25:09.320 --> 25:10.040
Bring it.

427
25:10.280 --> 25:11.520
You're going to lose.

428
25:11.560 --> 25:12.880
That's almost impossible.

429
25:14.600 --> 25:15.520
I'll take this character.

430
25:15.560 --> 25:17.080
It looks just as dumb as Pite.

431
25:17.080 --> 25:18.600
Now he wants to get in on...

432
25:18.640 --> 25:21.320
Director Pha-nu's condo units.

433
25:21.320 --> 25:22.840
I can't even turn him down.

434
25:22.840 --> 25:24.040
His mom asked me to let him in.

435
25:26.240 --> 25:27.160
P'Ing,

436
25:27.440 --> 25:29.440
I think Pite is nothing but trouble.

437
25:30.120 --> 25:32.800
Even with Itt watching over him, it's still a risk.

438
25:34.120 --> 25:35.960
Itt is younger.

439
25:36.240 --> 25:38.040
If Pite starts causing problems,

440
25:38.400 --> 25:39.560
will Itt even be able to handle him?

441
25:39.960 --> 25:41.280
He'll be just fine.

442
25:41.320 --> 25:44.640
Pite only needs to submit the documents as agreed,

443
25:44.640 --> 25:46.200
and Itt will handle the rest.

444
25:46.240 --> 25:48.200
As for right now, you just have to...

445
25:48.400 --> 25:52.760
wait for your doom in three, two, one.

446
25:53.000 --> 25:53.840
Done.

447
25:57.960 --> 25:59.040
I was just going easy on you.

448
25:59.040 --> 26:02.360
A noob will always be a noob, I guess.

449
26:02.400 --> 26:03.760
I was busy talking about Pite.

450
26:03.800 --> 26:05.320
Oh, really?

451
26:05.360 --> 26:06.800
So what? You still lost.

452
26:07.600 --> 26:08.960
Keep your promise.

453
26:08.960 --> 26:12.320
You have to go on a boat trip with me this Songkran.

454
26:13.200 --> 26:15.440
I can't, P'Ing. I have to go home.

455
26:15.480 --> 26:17.400
Jeez, what's the big deal?

456
26:17.720 --> 26:20.040
Afraid you won't win the Son of the Year award?

457
26:20.080 --> 26:22.040
If I don't go home this Songkran,

458
26:22.080 --> 26:24.720
I'll definitely be labeled an ungrateful son.

459
26:25.920 --> 26:27.480
Then just tell them that...

460
26:28.080 --> 26:30.680
you're being grateful right now

461
26:30.680 --> 26:32.080
by using your body

462
26:32.120 --> 26:34.280
to repay your mentor.

463
26:34.320 --> 26:35.040
Right?

464
26:35.240 --> 26:36.280
-Really? -Yeah.

465
26:39.200 --> 26:40.440
No, that tickles.

466
26:42.400 --> 26:43.160
P'Ing...

467
26:46.560 --> 26:47.360
Yok.

468
26:48.560 --> 26:49.320
Yok.

469
26:51.240 --> 26:52.560
Let's have a toast.

470
26:53.920 --> 26:56.080
Have a wonderful Songkran, everyone.

471
26:56.120 --> 26:57.600
You, too.

472
26:57.600 --> 26:58.800
-You, too. -Drink up.

473
27:03.640 --> 27:05.040
Ing is so good at his job,

474
27:05.440 --> 27:06.560
and Itt is doing great in school.

475
27:06.880 --> 27:08.480
He's won scholarships two years in a row.

476
27:09.120 --> 27:11.000
Having two fine sons like this,

477
27:11.320 --> 27:13.520
I could die today with no regrets.

478
27:13.920 --> 27:14.720
Isn't that right?

479
27:14.800 --> 27:15.840
-Absolutely. -Right.

480
27:15.880 --> 27:17.440
-A toast to the two of them. -Congratulations.

481
27:17.440 --> 27:19.520
-A toast to your nephews. -Cheers.

482
27:26.800 --> 27:27.480
P'Ing.

483
27:28.640 --> 27:29.800
You've had enough.

484
27:30.280 --> 27:31.560
Let me take you to your room.

485
27:31.600 --> 27:33.560
Ing, go take a quick nap upstairs

486
27:33.600 --> 27:35.360
and come back for another round later.

487
27:35.440 --> 27:36.880
It's only just past 9 p.m.

488
27:37.160 --> 27:39.480
I'll take him up to rest now.

489
27:39.920 --> 27:41.680
Okay. Take good care of your brother.

490
27:43.200 --> 27:44.840
Hold him steady.

491
27:49.320 --> 27:50.400
-Come on. -Alright.

492
27:51.280 --> 27:52.360
Watch out.

493
27:55.800 --> 27:56.520
P'Ing,

494
27:56.800 --> 27:58.600
Auntie Aoi said your room isn't ready yet.

495
27:58.920 --> 28:00.200
You can sleep in my room for now.

496
28:13.200 --> 28:14.280
Itt,

497
28:14.280 --> 28:15.880
the money you got today...

498
28:16.720 --> 28:18.200
Don't waste it, okay?

499
28:19.000 --> 28:21.200
You're grown up. Start getting something of your own.

500
28:21.960 --> 28:23.040
Don't worry.

501
28:26.840 --> 28:28.560
So, how's the condo project going?

502
28:29.920 --> 28:31.080
Everything is on hold for now,

503
28:31.720 --> 28:33.800
but I'll get it all sorted out after Songkran.

504
28:33.800 --> 28:35.160
There aren't any issues at the moment.

505
28:36.400 --> 28:37.680
What about Pite?

506
28:38.280 --> 28:40.040
Has he been causing any trouble?

507
28:42.600 --> 28:43.840
He listens to me just fine.

508
28:44.320 --> 28:45.920
Keep a close eye on him.

509
28:46.640 --> 28:48.160
Let me know if anything happens.

510
28:50.400 --> 28:51.160
Will do.

511
28:51.800 --> 28:52.680
Now, go on.

512
28:53.680 --> 28:55.680
Just go away. I want to sleep now.

513
28:57.920 --> 28:58.720
Okay.

514
29:11.840 --> 29:12.760
P'Ing...

515
29:26.640 --> 29:30.040
It's been so long since I've seen you fall asleep.

516
29:35.120 --> 29:36.600
Your lips are so soft,

517
29:37.400 --> 29:40.520
but how come you never say anything nice to me?

518
30:06.760 --> 30:07.560
Yok...

519
31:00.080 --> 31:00.840
Oh...

520
31:02.560 --> 31:03.200
Hey.

521
31:03.880 --> 31:04.800
What a coincidence.

522
31:05.760 --> 31:06.520
Hold on.

523
31:07.080 --> 31:08.120
What's with the rush?

524
31:08.840 --> 31:10.080
I just got some money.

525
31:11.600 --> 31:13.080
Come on, my treat.

526
31:14.800 --> 31:15.680
Come on.

527
31:34.920 --> 31:35.680
What are you doing?

528
32:01.800 --> 32:02.560
Open up.

529
32:11.240 --> 32:12.920
Let's go sit down over there.

530
32:25.160 --> 32:26.440
What brings you to Bangkok?

531
32:27.240 --> 32:28.440
I'm always here.

532
32:29.720 --> 32:30.640
I went to Pattaya

533
32:31.040 --> 32:32.320
on a trip with my client.

534
32:32.640 --> 32:33.440
What about you?

535
32:34.680 --> 32:36.440
Why are you all alone on Songkran?

536
32:40.440 --> 32:43.080
Last time, you were stealing candy.

537
32:43.200 --> 32:44.400
What are you up to this time?

538
32:49.200 --> 32:51.920
Next time, if you want some candy,

539
32:52.720 --> 32:53.640
just buy it.

540
32:54.880 --> 32:56.120
Don't do that kind of thing again.

541
32:56.240 --> 32:57.360
What right do you have to lecture me?

542
32:58.320 --> 32:59.320
Look,

543
33:00.600 --> 33:02.280
you always take someone's good intentions

544
33:02.320 --> 33:03.400
as a lecture, don't you?

545
33:13.040 --> 33:15.600
Lock on. That's our target.

546
33:16.040 --> 33:18.120
Happy Songkran My name is Force.

547
33:18.600 --> 33:20.000
See you

548
33:24.360 --> 33:25.600
I was sleeping so soundly

549
33:25.640 --> 33:26.760
I forgot to call Yok.

550
33:27.280 --> 33:29.440
Anyway, why hasn't he called me yet?

551
33:31.560 --> 33:32.360
Oh, here it is.

552
33:33.240 --> 33:34.040
[My Capy: Happy Songkran Day.]

553
33:34.120 --> 33:35.080
[May you always be happy]

554
33:35.080 --> 33:35.640
[and prosperous.]

555
33:35.680 --> 33:37.600
"Happy Songkran.

556
33:37.920 --> 33:42.080
May you always be happy and prosperous."

557
33:44.440 --> 33:47.360
Isn't this the kind of message you send to your parents?

558
33:52.280 --> 33:53.080
Hello?

559
33:54.240 --> 33:56.240
Hello. You're up already?

560
33:57.000 --> 33:59.480
Yeah. Why didn't you call me last night?

561
33:59.840 --> 34:01.120
Well, I called Itt last night.

562
34:01.280 --> 34:03.440
He said you'd passed out drunk,

563
34:03.560 --> 34:04.960
so I didn't call.

564
34:07.320 --> 34:08.440
Next time, just call me.

565
34:08.440 --> 34:10.159
Why would you even call Itt?

566
34:10.199 --> 34:11.080
I'm not dead yet.

567
34:11.120 --> 34:12.679
Why leave a message with him?

568
34:13.159 --> 34:14.920
Are you still not sober yet?

569
34:16.000 --> 34:17.920
I'm sober now, thanks to your message.

570
34:18.679 --> 34:20.639
What kind of message were you expecting?

571
34:22.920 --> 34:23.920
I'm done talking to you.

572
34:23.960 --> 34:24.880
You're annoying.

573
34:29.840 --> 34:31.239
-Hey, Ing. -I shouldn't have called him.

574
34:31.280 --> 34:32.159
You're up now?

575
34:33.159 --> 34:34.400
I have something to ask you.

576
34:37.639 --> 34:38.560
Yes, Dad.

577
34:39.600 --> 34:41.280
When are you going to visit Grandpa?

578
34:42.520 --> 34:44.000
I'm planning to see...

579
34:45.560 --> 34:46.800
Mom's relatives tomorrow,

580
34:46.800 --> 34:48.480
then I'll head to Grandpa's in two days.

581
34:48.520 --> 34:50.560
Are you bringing your brother along?

582
34:52.400 --> 34:53.159
Are you coming?

583
34:53.440 --> 34:54.120
I'd love to.

584
34:54.159 --> 34:55.639
I haven't seen Grandpa in ages.

585
34:57.280 --> 34:58.600
You've grown up, haven't you?

586
35:01.560 --> 35:02.280
Right,

587
35:02.400 --> 35:06.680
I'm thinking of taking Itt to see the Sukonsiris as well.

588
35:07.040 --> 35:08.720
Oh, that's even better.

589
35:09.280 --> 35:10.320
It'd be good for you two

590
35:10.320 --> 35:12.320
to get to know their kids.

591
35:13.520 --> 35:14.360
In that case,

592
35:14.360 --> 35:15.880
could you let Uncle Pongpaisan know

593
35:15.880 --> 35:17.160
that I'll be bringing Itt along?

594
35:17.960 --> 35:19.600
Sure, I'll give him a call.

595
35:24.600 --> 35:26.160
I'm coming for you, Yok.

596
35:29.280 --> 35:30.240
Thank you.

597
35:30.280 --> 35:31.680
Please enjoy your meal.

598
35:32.400 --> 35:33.560
I see.

599
35:34.720 --> 35:37.280
So this is khao chae, the royal Thai dish?

600
35:38.800 --> 35:39.720
I've never seen it before.

601
35:39.760 --> 35:41.600
This is my first time getting to try it.

602
35:42.080 --> 35:43.280
Well, we make this ourselves

603
35:43.280 --> 35:44.400
every Songkran.

604
35:44.440 --> 35:46.120
It's an heirloom recipe from my great-grandmother.

605
35:46.640 --> 35:48.080
You'll fall in love with it once you try it.

606
35:48.120 --> 35:49.280
How are we supposed to eat it?

607
35:49.360 --> 35:51.680
Eat the side dishes first to awaken your taste buds.

608
35:52.000 --> 35:53.320
Then eat the rice.

609
35:53.880 --> 35:55.680
Don't mix the sides into the rice, though.

610
35:56.480 --> 35:57.640
Go ahead and try it.

611
36:03.040 --> 36:04.360
It smells so good, and it's delicious.

612
36:04.360 --> 36:05.200
I'm not surprised

613
36:05.240 --> 36:06.920
that you like it so much.

614
36:07.040 --> 36:08.680
I'm starting to get hooked on it myself.

615
36:09.000 --> 36:10.160
If you like it that much,

616
36:10.320 --> 36:11.680
come join us again next Songkran.

617
36:11.720 --> 36:12.920
Oh, I'd love to.

618
36:13.200 --> 36:14.000
You're always welcome.

619
36:14.000 --> 36:15.800
Oh, I almost forgot to ask.

620
36:15.800 --> 36:18.160
Itt gave you the report on the land survey

621
36:18.200 --> 36:19.640
in Pattaya already, right?

622
36:20.080 --> 36:21.080
Yes, he did.

623
36:21.120 --> 36:22.920
The company mentioned that the plot of land

624
36:22.920 --> 36:23.920
is in an excellent location.

625
36:23.920 --> 36:26.280
So, what stage are we at now?

626
36:26.400 --> 36:28.240
We're currently working on the draft.

627
36:28.240 --> 36:29.880
I'll send it to you as soon as it's ready.

628
36:30.000 --> 36:31.880
Please let me know once it's done.

629
36:31.920 --> 36:33.160
I'll get the next steps moving right away.

630
36:33.520 --> 36:35.600
I'm sure everything will go quite smoothly.

631
36:35.600 --> 36:36.680
Absolutely.

632
36:36.680 --> 36:38.920
May I oversee this project?

633
36:45.240 --> 36:46.520
That sounds like a great idea, Mr. Phet.

634
36:47.360 --> 36:48.520
Yok is your brother,

635
36:48.560 --> 36:49.480
and he's working with me.

636
36:49.480 --> 36:50.600
So I can just pass messages

637
36:50.600 --> 36:51.400
to you through him.

638
36:51.440 --> 36:52.440
That'll make things easier.

639
36:53.320 --> 36:55.360
Sounds good. Let's go with that.

640
36:56.760 --> 36:58.600
We've got some desserts, too.

641
36:58.640 --> 36:59.520
I'll go get them.

642
37:00.000 --> 37:00.800
Thank you.

643
37:05.160 --> 37:07.360
Itt, have you bought that new game yet?

644
37:07.400 --> 37:08.320
Which one?

645
37:08.480 --> 37:10.080
I've been busy with the work P'Ing gave me,

646
37:10.120 --> 37:11.160
so I haven't had the time.

647
37:12.480 --> 37:13.360
All you do is work.

648
37:13.400 --> 37:14.920
Songkran is a long holiday, isn't it?

649
37:15.280 --> 37:16.320
Let's play together sometime.

650
37:17.600 --> 37:19.000
Gaming strains your eyes.

651
37:19.120 --> 37:20.200
You shouldn't play anymore.

652
37:23.960 --> 37:25.320
Your eyes get tired from working, too.

653
37:38.120 --> 37:38.920
Here it is.

654
37:45.280 --> 37:46.360
Thank you very much.

655
37:50.120 --> 37:51.760
Yok, what's wrong?

656
37:51.800 --> 37:52.920
You're all hunched over.

657
37:54.920 --> 37:56.080
I think I'm getting a cramp.

658
37:56.520 --> 37:57.720
Have you been overtraining in boxing?

659
37:57.920 --> 37:59.200
Take better care of yourself.

660
37:59.880 --> 38:00.480
I will.

661
38:16.400 --> 38:18.400
Thank you so much for the khao chae.

662
38:18.400 --> 38:19.720
It was quite a new experience.

663
38:19.760 --> 38:20.600
My pleasure.

664
38:20.600 --> 38:22.560
I'm sorry if I wasn't the best host.

665
38:23.880 --> 38:24.840
Excuse me.

666
38:27.440 --> 38:29.120
Yok, I'll leave them in your hands.

667
38:30.080 --> 38:31.320
-Got it. -Excuse me.

668
38:34.720 --> 38:35.920
Itt, come here.

669
38:39.800 --> 38:40.520
Get in.

670
38:42.600 --> 38:43.640
Get in the car.

671
39:07.320 --> 39:08.200
What are you doing?

672
39:11.200 --> 39:12.120
No, what are you doing?

673
39:12.400 --> 39:13.560
We haven't seen each other for days,

674
39:13.600 --> 39:14.920
not even during Songkran.

675
39:15.000 --> 39:16.920
What's with that message you sent?

676
39:16.960 --> 39:18.240
Was that meant for your parents?

677
39:18.280 --> 39:19.200
Now that I'm finally here,

678
39:19.240 --> 39:20.800
you're acting all disgusted.

679
39:20.800 --> 39:22.040
Do I look that disgusting?

680
39:23.040 --> 39:23.800
P'Ing,

681
39:24.080 --> 39:25.400
do we have to talk about it now?

682
39:26.040 --> 39:27.000
Someone might see us.

683
39:28.160 --> 39:29.000
Fine.

684
39:31.320 --> 39:33.560
If you're that afraid, we can talk later.

685
39:48.440 --> 39:49.440
Let's go.

686
40:11.480 --> 40:12.600
[Yok]

687
40:22.320 --> 40:23.200
Hello?

688
40:24.800 --> 40:26.080
Were you sleeping?

689
40:27.680 --> 40:29.160
Well, I was going to.

690
40:31.320 --> 40:32.640
It's not even midnight yet.

691
40:32.960 --> 40:34.440
You never go to bed this early.

692
40:36.160 --> 40:38.320
I'm visiting my grandpa tomorrow morning.

693
40:38.600 --> 40:39.680
Oh...

694
40:41.240 --> 40:42.240
Is something up?

695
40:44.600 --> 40:46.400
I was thinking we could go out tomorrow.

696
40:49.520 --> 40:52.160
We just saw each other. You miss me already?

697
40:56.240 --> 40:57.560
If you're not available, it's okay.

698
40:57.640 --> 40:59.080
We can meet after you get back.

699
40:59.080 --> 41:00.080
Wait, hold on.

700
41:01.400 --> 41:03.360
You can come to my condo now.

701
41:04.720 --> 41:05.680
Right now?

702
41:05.840 --> 41:06.640
Yeah.

703
41:07.000 --> 41:07.760
Alright.

704
41:08.160 --> 41:09.280
But you'll have to wait.

705
41:09.640 --> 41:11.360
I can't leave until my family's gone to bed.

706
41:11.600 --> 41:12.400
Okay.

707
42:57.640 --> 42:59.160
Have you ever thought about me?

708
42:59.560 --> 43:00.400
You can do whatever you want,

709
43:00.400 --> 43:01.840
but I can't.

710
43:03.400 --> 43:04.040
Fight.

711
43:04.040 --> 43:04.080
Fight.

712
43:04.680 --> 43:06.120
You don't know anything

713
43:06.600 --> 43:06.640
about us or my training.

714
43:06.640 --> 43:07.600
about us or my training.

715
43:07.600 --> 43:07.800
about us or my training.

716
43:09.160 --> 43:09.840
Whoa...

717
43:09.840 --> 43:09.960
Whoa...

718
43:12.080 --> 43:12.840
Yeah.

719
43:19.080 --> 43:20.320
I trusted you with this.

720
43:20.320 --> 43:21.600
What the hell have you done?

721
43:22.120 --> 43:23.920
P'Ing, I didn't do it.
